@startuml
title 管理员 - 用户管理时序图

actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "浏览器/用户管理\n(admin/Users.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "管理员控制器\nAdminController" as AdminCtrl
participant "用户服务\nUserService" as UserSvc
database "UserRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

== 列表/搜索 ==
Admin -> UI: 打开“用户管理”或搜索
UI -> Axios: GET /api/admin/users[?keyword]
alt 无关键字
  Axios -> AdminCtrl: getAllUsers()
  AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: getAllUsers()
  UserSvc -> DB: findAll()
  AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 [User...]
else 有关键字
  Axios -> AdminCtrl: searchUsers(keyword)
  AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: searchUsers(keyword)
  UserSvc -> DB: findByUsernameContainingOrEmailContaining
  AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 [User...]
end

== 创建 ==
Admin -> UI: 新建用户
UI -> Axios: POST /api/admin/users\n{ username,password,email,role,... }
Axios -> AdminCtrl: createUser(user)
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: createUser(user)
UserSvc -> UserSvc: 编码密码
UserSvc -> DB: 保存
AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message }

== 更新 ==
UI -> Axios: PUT /api/admin/users/{id}\n{ ... }
Axios -> AdminCtrl: updateUser(id, user)
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: updateUser(user)
UserSvc -> DB: 保存
AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message }

== 删除 ==
UI -> Axios: DELETE /api/admin/users/{id}
Axios -> AdminCtrl: deleteUser(id)
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: deleteUser(id)
UserSvc -> DB: deleteById
AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message }

== 导入 ==
UI -> Axios: POST /api/admin/users/import (multipart: file)
Axios -> AdminCtrl: importUsers(file)
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: importUsers(file)
UserSvc -> UserSvc: 解析 Excel 并批量创建/跳过/更新
AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message: summary }

== 导出 ==
UI -> Axios: GET /api/admin/users/export (responseType=blob)
Axios -> AdminCtrl: exportUsers()
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: exportUsersToExcel()
AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 xlsx 二进制

== 下载导入模板 ==
UI -> Axios: GET /api/admin/users/import/template (responseType=blob)
Axios -> AdminCtrl: downloadUsersImportTemplate()
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: generateUsersImportTemplate()
AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 xlsx 二进制

== 修改用户密码（管理员口令确认） ==
Admin -> UI: 输入新密码与管理员口令
UI -> Axios: PUT /api/admin/users/{id}/password\n{ newPassword, adminPassword }
Axios -> AdminCtrl: changeUserPassword(id, body)
AdminCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 adminUsername
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: changeUserPasswordWithAdminConfirm(targetId, newPwd, adminUsername, adminPassword)
UserSvc -> DB: 验证管理员身份与口令、写入新密码
AdminCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message }

@enduml

